  - text: This is your living room?
    displayText: This is your living room?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: I think so.
    displayText: I think so.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: It looks even older and messier than the bedroom.$.$.
    displayText: It looks even older and messier than the bedroom...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4ec1ce6e63321a941829a1566caac4f2, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 3100000032000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Not my fault. $$It's not my responsibility. $$I don't usually spend time
      outside of my own room in the first place.
    displayText: Not my fault. It's not my responsibility. I don't usually spend
      time outside of my own room in the first place.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0e0000000e0000002a0000002a000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: I didn't blame you for it though.$.$.
    displayText: I didn't blame you for it though...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2100000022000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Hey! $$What's that jigsaw board? $$Has it always been there?
    displayText: Hey! What's that jigsaw board? Has it always been there?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 05000000050000001f0000001f000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Definitely not that I know of.
    displayText: Definitely not that I know of.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098a4f2cb9f2e2646b1a6906da2c3558, type: 3}
